<Project>

  <!--
    Transitive NuGet audit suppression (applies to every project under services/api).

    GHSA-v5pm-xwqc-g5wc (NU1903, "high") affects Microsoft.OpenApi, pulled transitively by
    Swashbuckle.AspNetCore 10.x. The advisory affects all 2.x releases; the fix is in Microsoft.OpenApi
    3.x, which is a breaking change Swashbuckle 10.x is NOT built against (forcing 3.x breaks swagger
    generation at runtime). The vulnerability concerns PARSING untrusted OpenAPI documents — this API
    only GENERATES and serves its own swagger doc, so the attack vector does not apply to us.

    Remove this suppression once Swashbuckle ships a release built on a patched Microsoft.OpenApi.
  -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <NuGetAuditSuppress Include="https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-v5pm-xwqc-g5wc" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <!--
    SixLabors.ImageSharp 3.1.11, advisories published 2026-10-08 and after. 3.2.0 and 4.1.2 fix every one of them,
    but both refuse to build without a Six Labors license key (checked 2026-11-05). Decision (owner, 2026-10-08): stay
    on 3.1.x for now. How each one stands against our single use (InventoryPhotoStorageService: decode, auto-orient, resize,
    re-encode as JPEG):

    - GHSA-j3p4-wp97-rph4 (high): HistogramEqualization. Never called.
    - GHSA-j9gm-c75j-xc9q, GHSA-jjfr-hcj7-qf5w (high): TIFF CCITT T4/T6 encoders. We only encode JPEG.
    - GHSA-wmxv-xphr-5c9g (medium): BigTIFF decoding can loop. Closed: decoding is restricted to JPEG, PNG and WebP,
      so TIFF bytes, however they are labelled, are refused (tested).
    - GHSA-v76p-62qx-wwq2 (high, 2026-11): tiled fax TIFF decoding writes out of bounds. Closed the same way: TIFF is
      never decoded.
    - GHSA-gwg2-r3hj-4w44 (medium): ICC profile parsing can over-allocate. STILL OPEN: JPEG/PNG/WebP can carry ICC
      profiles. Exposure is limited to authenticated operators' uploads and marketplace photos, under an 8 MB cap.

    Remove these once photo processing moves to a patched or differently licensed library.
  -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <NuGetAuditSuppress Include="https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-j3p4-wp97-rph4" />
    <NuGetAuditSuppress Include="https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-j9gm-c75j-xc9q" />
    <NuGetAuditSuppress Include="https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-jjfr-hcj7-qf5w" />
    <NuGetAuditSuppress Include="https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-wmxv-xphr-5c9g" />
    <NuGetAuditSuppress Include="https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-gwg2-r3hj-4w44" />
    <NuGetAuditSuppress Include="https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-v76p-62qx-wwq2" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
